      "content": "Wait, \"slightly above the intended baseline\"? I just saw a preview of the raw win-rate data for the master/grandmaster tier and he's hitting 85%. That's not a \"minor adjustment\" territory, that's a complete nightmare for the pro scene. Are you sure you aren't underselling how broken he actually is? If we push this through as is, the competitive community is going to tear us apart. Is there a reason you're suggesting just a small tweak instead of a major nerf?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
