      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Given the 85% win rate you cited, my initial assessment clearly needs to be corrected; Xylos is currently too powerful for stable pro play. The reason I suggested a minor tweak was based on earlier, less extreme data, but your latest numbers indicate a significant power ceiling issue. To prevent community backlash and preserve the competitive scene, I strongly advise implementing a more substantial reduction to his sustain or damage profile before the ladder launch.",
